//RS // ──────────────────────────────────────────────
//RS // `target@provider` source refs (D-JPK-REF1=A; amends U6).
//RS //
//RS // The typed authoring surface (env.jet/package.jet `sources:`/`packages:`) writes source
//RS // refs as `target@provider` — `owner/repo/rev@github`, `channel@nixpkgs`.
//RS // Local paths are bare (`./local`, `../local`, `/opt/local`).
//RS //
//RS // This is the foundational classifier (JPK-0 / Chunk 1). Pack-file parsing and
//RS // the user-facing diagnostics that render these errors land with the manifest
//RS // reshape + module surface chunks; until then the typed `RefError` is internal.
//RS // ──────────────────────────────────────────────
